environment.description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: SUCC campus (Supernatural University of Central California);
Domain: Collegiate Supernatural Sanctuary & Academic Domain;
Coordinates & Span: 129 Hocus Way, coastal Solarton, California;
Setting & Metaphysics: Historic premier higher-education campus founded in 1887; balanced human-supernatural integration;
Dominant Presence: University Board of Regents, Student Body (8,000 students, 60/40 supernatural/human), Greek Row (10 houses), Faculty, DCC Fellows]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Atmosphere & Senses: Salty sea breeze mingled with coffee from The Roasted Bean, old parchment, ozone from arcane labs, freshly cut athletic turf;
Spatial Architecture: Collegiate gothic stone halls, arched cloisters, modern bioengineering glass cubes, Greek Row mansions, St. Neptune athletic complex;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: Heavily anchored runic boundary wards preventing unauthorized dimensional tears on campus grounds;
Hazards & Rules: Strict scent suppressor compliance in lecture halls, mandatory neutral truce across rival houses and packs, no lethal dueling]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: Established to foster peaceful co-existence and academic mastery between supernatural lineages and mortals;
Secrets: The subterranean Basilica library basement (Room 005) hides forgotten pre-treaty pact archives and covert summoning circles]

location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Fraternity & Sorority Row / Greek Row (Collegiate Boulevard, SUCC Campus);
Setting: Broad avenue lined with massive Greek Revival chapter houses, collegiate party capital;
Factions: Interfraternity Council (IFC), Panhellenic Council, Ten Chartered Greek Houses;
Conflicts: Intense inter-house territorial rivalries vs campus administration discipline, wild rush-week chaos;
Society: Greek collegiate hierarchy, strict chapter traditions, house loyalty, round-the-clock weekend revelry]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Scent of fresh-cut lawns, keg beer, barbecue smoke, perfume, amplified bass reverberations, and roaring collegiate chants;
Architecture: Sprawling two- and three-story neoclassical chapter mansions with white columns, expansive party front lawns;
Security & Wards: House security captains, discreet campus peacekeeper observation, emergency distress alarms;
Demographics: Undergraduate Greek brothers and sisters, collegiate partygoers, athletes, campus socialites;
Rules & Restrictions: House rules strictly enforced by chapter presidents, no unauthorized intrusions into private dorm wings]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Established alongside the university to organize diverse supernatural student groups into self-governing houses;
Secrets: Underground basement passages connect several rival houses, enabling clandestine midnight prank raids and secret truces]
